{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 63899, "game_id": 202, "entry_id": 47111, "uid": 55158, "type": 4, "title": "四星天子点火推荐？", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1608120678, "updated_at": 1631090517, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1619598041, "last_at": 0, "comment_count": 9, "status": 1, "summary": "1.前言1.14会开启四星天子点火。四星的话，不建议给刀点火，还是长期收益的问题，当然如果说是准备duel，那也可以点火。主要是介绍点火后比较特别的四星。当然，四星默认+6。注意点：①简易版，把我认为", "thumb": "", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 3, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 15437, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 63899, "content": "<div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">1.前言</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div><span><span><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\nfont-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"><font face=\"宋体\"></font></span></p></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"宋体\">1.14会开启四星天子点火。</font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">四星的话，不建议给刀点火，还是长期收益的问题，当然如果说是准备duel，那也可以点火。主要是介绍点火后比较特别的四星。当然，四星默认+6。<br></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\"><font face=\"宋体\">注意点：</font></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p></span></span><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">①简易版，把我认为不要紧的技能变化删去了，完整版可以去<a href=\"https://gamewith.jp/destiny-child/article/show/79824\" target=\"_blank\">这里</a></span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">。<span></span></span></p></span></span></div><span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">②仅代表个人意见，同时由于没有实战可能有误判<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">。</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: Calibri;\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">③以下点火的技能变化均基于日服，国际服请以实装后的数据为准<span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span>。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; line-height: 150%;\">④冷知识：经过测试，天命之子的优先最低血/最高血其实是优先（百分比）最低血/最高血。<br></span></p></span></span></span></span></span><span><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;\nline-height:150%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;line-height:150%;\nfont-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;\"></span></p></span></span></div><div><span><div class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" contenteditable=\"false\"><p class=\"title-p\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2.技能变化一览</span><br></p></div></span><br></div><div><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617679960_25022172.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617679960_25022172.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp; 吉他妹</span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">点火简述：3红，ss暴击率暴伤幅度增加；6红，ss暴击率暴伤幅度进一步增加。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">简评：不推荐点火。性价比不够高，6红后数值基本和+6泡面持平。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">==============================================================================<br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617834279_58015047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617834279_58015047.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">火镰刀</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></span><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">点火简述：2红，ts减防幅度增加；3红，ss减防幅度增加。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">简评：不推荐点火。性价比不够高，3红后ts和ss的减防幅度和+6木伞（防御力-1495）基本持平，但是缺少了木伞乱舞之刃的20%，通常作为低加木伞的保险上场。</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">==============================================================================</span></span></span></span></div><div><span><span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617854732_47082044.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617854732_47082044.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"></span>跳窗</span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span><span></span></span>点火简述：3红，ss减攻变百分比，弱点防御下降幅度增加；6红，ss弱点防御下降幅度进一步增加。</div><div>简评：可以点火。3红后，ss优先最高攻敌方两体，12s内攻击力-94.6%、弱点防御-32.9%；6红后，变为98.6%和37.9%。3红后有高达94.6%的减攻幅度，6红后，弱点防御下降幅度已经和+6木基佬基本持平。可能有人会考虑减攻+攻守互换的变相减防思路，但是可行性问题很大，这里不多展开了。<br></div></span><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">再提一句，以后木基佬有上位，4红以后全属性通用的弱点防御-80.4%。</span></div><div>=========================================================================================</div><div><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617868760_44465357.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617868760_44465357.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">忧郁的尼曼</span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">点火简述：3红，ss减攻变百分比；6红，ss2体变3体。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">简评：不推荐点火。3红后，ss优先最高攻敌方两体，12s内攻击力-97.6%，暴击率-55.4%。6红以后是3体，能够有效针对PVP环境中的暴击队。</span></span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\">==============================================================================</span></span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><span></span></span><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617706232_1279816.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1; width: 97px; height: 88.6111px;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617706232_1279816.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">肉球</span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">点火简述：3红，ss优先最高攻2体的攻击力提升变百分比；6红，ss攻击力提升幅度增加，新增ts最终伤害提升。</span></span></div><div><span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">简评：不推荐点火。原因是在点火环境下，ts刀已经不行了。肉球人称小熊妹，区别是熊妹3红就变而且是3体，但是熊妹要等火属性五星天子点火，而且五星天子3红的材料消耗是高于四星天子6红的，当然熊妹有立绘优势和潜力优势（熊妹6红进一步提升数值）。</span></span></div><div><span></span>=========================================================================================</div><div><span><img draggable=\"false\" class=\"index-icon is-load-img\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617321229_65442210.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\" style=\"opacity: 1;\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/dc/1596617321229_65442210.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">飞刀哥</span></span></div><div><span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span>点火简述：3红，ss新增乱舞之刃。</span></div><div><span>简评：<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">推荐点火（待测）。</span></span>日服经过测试，乱舞之刃可叠加。若国际服也可叠加，飞刀哥配合木伞，WB中可以轻易将boss防御力减到0。</span></div></span><div><span></span><br></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": null, "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 55158, "username": "Kyun", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/12.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 194, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 99017156, "content_num": 1065, "read_num": 2013197, "like_num": 1043}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 202, "name": "天命之子", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1600339074877_54241879.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "dc", "content_count": 7758, "follow_count": 14519}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": null, "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cdn": "", "emoji": [{"id": 6, "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_676/h_676/215/236746/2025/11/15/332900.png", "count": 0, "is_like": false}, {"id": 4,